+  # Simulate the exact incident shape: the fix agent did real work
+  # (artifact + commit) and exited cleanly, but the Stop hook never wrote
+  # `.done`, so the exit_code_only wait drained to its deadline. The
+  # shared completion predicate must let the pass reach SUCCESS with a
+  # WARN-level claude_completion_fallback event instead of REVIEW_ERROR.
+  def test_fix_pass_clean_exit_without_stop_hook_signal_reaches_success_via_fallback
